\caption(The left panel shows the combined edge weights. The right panel shows the two propagated feature channels. Isolated receiver 2 has a zero row in both.)
\alttext(Heatmaps of a five-by-four adjacency matrix and its five-by-two propagated features.)

The public COO operation works directly on the coordinate list. The dense
matrix in this example provides a small reference for checking the result.
